  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *atrapado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to catch\" or \"to trap\" — *atrapar una pelota* (to catch a ball), *el ratón quedó atrapado* (the mouse got trapped)",
    "Also used figuratively for being captivated: *esa canción me atrapó desde el principio* (that song captivated me from the start)",
    "Related: *trampa* (trap, noun — same root), *atrapado/a* (trapped, caught)"
